+    "Whoa, easy there, pal.",
+    "Watch where you're stepping!",
+    "Seriously? Plenty of sidewalk here.",
+  ],
+  hit: [
+    "Argh! Somebody call an ambulance!",
+    "Ow! What the hell?!",
+    "My leg! You hit me!",
+    "Help! He just ran right into me!",
+  ],
+  panic: [
+    "Shots fired! Get down!",
