+   * Tone control. `rumble` 0..2 scales the low-end lift (1 = default +7 dB
+   * shelf at 135 Hz plus a +4 dB bump at 72 Hz), `brightness` 0..2 scales the
+   * high shelf (1 = default -5 dB above 3.2 kHz; >1 opens it back up).
